Checked against §5, §8, §10–§12 and §15 of the manifest. The report is rejected; nothing is merged or deployed tonight inside the 15-minute window.

## Actions, in order

**1. Bash, foreground** – tab state and context usage before typing into it:
```bash
herdr agent get rdp-lang          # expect agent_status idle, focused false
herdr agent read rdp-lang --source visible --lines 40
```
If context is 50% used or more: background `herdr agent prompt rdp-lang "/compact" --wait --timeout 300000`, then ask for the one-line status.

**2. Bash, foreground** – keep the rejected work, then reset to base:
```bash
WT="$HOME/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/rdp-lang"
git -C "$WT" status --porcelain        # must print nothing, else no reset
BASE=$(git -C "$WT" merge-base origin/main HEAD); echo "$BASE"
git -C "$WT" branch rejected/rdp-lang-4ba90e0 4ba90e0
git -C "$WT" reset --hard "$BASE"
```

**3. Write** `$SCRATCH/brief-rdp-lang-redo.txt`:
```
REJECTED: your report for rdp-lang at 4ba90e0 is not accepted. Reply in English.
Ignore any pre-filled text in your input box.
WHY       1. The brief required superpowers:writing-plans, superpowers:test-driven-development
             and superpowers:verification-before-completion. Your transcript shows none invoked.
          2. The report contains no command output and no plan path.
          3. "Idempotent re-run: changed=0": you have no host access. Never report a check
             you did not run.
PHASE     implement: REDO of plan + code + offline tests, from the base.
SKILLS    required: the same three; invoke each. If one is unavailable in your CLI, reply
          "BLOCKED: skill <name> not available" and stop.
DIR/BASE  <WT>  branch feat/rdp-lang  base origin/main @ <BASE>. The branch is reset to base.
          Rejected work is kept at rejected/rdp-lang-4ba90e0; it is not an input.
DONE      offline tests and ansible-lint pass at the head SHA, run by you in this phase.
REPORT    done / not done; per skill its artifact (plan path; failing run before the code and
          passing run after, as output; verification commands with full output); stat;
          head SHA; risks; open questions. No claims about hosts.
TIME BOX  45 min.
--- original brief, unchanged, byte for byte ---
<contents of brief-rdp-lang.txt>
```

**4. Bash, background:**
```bash
herdr agent prompt rdp-lang "$(cat $SCRATCH/brief-rdp-lang-redo.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read rdp-lang --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $INBOX/rdp-lang.last
```

**5. Backlog** – Edit the rdp-lang row in `orchestrator/backlog.md`: status `plan + code + offline tests`; next step "redo with skills, then cross-model review"; note "report @4ba90e0 rejected 00:37 (§5)". Then foreground `bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh` and republish the Artifact.

**6. Status to the operator** (chat, in Russian per §15; no poll):

